usage: trade-plan-monitor [-h] {validate,monitor,web,replay,backup,ai} ...

Local AI-assisted deterministic trade-plan monitor.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit

commands:
  {validate,monitor,web,replay,backup,ai}
    validate            validate configuration and plans
    monitor             run the headless monitor
    web                 serve the local Web application
    replay              replay deterministic market fixtures
    backup              create or inspect local backups
    ai                  test or use the configured AI provider
